        },
        {
          "text": " Kolomunete do idwe luka inabin lukeiaas Besel neejai Elisa, kotemasi ŋes atiar, “Ŋeni ebe eyaŋaari EJAKAIT ekoniiakait kama ijai ijo lolo?” Kobala ŋesi ebe, “Eebo, ajeni, kililinata yesi,”",
          "type": "text",
