        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kotema Eliya ŋes atiar, “Keŋaiŋait, Elisa, kopaik ne; naarai kejukit EJAKAIT eoŋ Yeriko,” Kobala ŋesi ebe, “Kwape ejaria EJAKAIT, ido kwape ejaria ekonitau da, mam kajali jo.” Kosodete kodolo Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikunyakis idwe luka inabin lukejaas Yeriko neejai Elisa, kotemasi ŋes atiar, “Ŋeni ebe eyaŋaari EJAKAIT ekonijakait kama ijai ijo lolo?” Koboijok ŋesi ebe, “Eebo, ajeni; kililinata yesi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
