        },
        {
          "text": " Kolem elou loka Eliya loabu kodou, kinomia akipi, kotema atiar, “Ai bo ejai EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Eliya?” Ido kedau ŋesi da ainomia akipi, kotiakas epuai ka epuai: kotubor Elisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
