              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Asw 8:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotemasi ŋes atiar, “Koany, ejaas ituŋa akaisakany lukagogonok, nepepe kikonibulesin; kinainait, koloto kesi amoot ejakaitikon: motoko edakarit emoyo loka EJAKAIT ŋes kocaka ŋes oroŋat, arai bo aditot.” Kotema atiar, “Mam iyakiarete kes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimaimaata ŋes aitodol neeleicikinio, kotema atiar, “Kiyakiasi do,” Kanuka ŋun kiyakiarai ituŋa akaisakany; komoata adaun apaarasia auni, konye mam apotu kodumut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobonut mama ejai, eroko idarit koYeriko; kotema kes atiar, “Mam abu kalimok yes ebe, ‘Sirikiloto?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
